{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Let them be ashamed</b> — its sense is together, corresponding to <b>gathered themselves together against me</b> (Psalm 35:15). And the form מגדילים is deficient, and it is a word or expression."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {0 "Resolved נאספו עלי נכים as a reference to Psalms 35:15 (נֶאֶסְפוּ עָלַי נֵכִים), which is the verse this comment parallels."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:44.757119816Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}